{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1001", "sample_idx": 0, "model_name": "mistralai/ministral-14b-instruct-2512", "content": "Hark hark good traveler of lands far and wide\nLet quill and parchment now weave thy grand design\nFor Japan’s fair shores where gods and mortals twine\n\n---\n**Upon the Morrow of Thy Departure**\nFrom London’s mist or New York’s bustling tide\nThou shalt embark with haste where cherry blooms abide\nTo Tokyo’s port where neon lights do gleam\nAye gird thee well for wonders yet unseen\n\n---\n**First Day in Tokyo’s Grand and Glorious Realm**\nRise with the sun and let not sloth delay\nTo Asakusa’s gates where Kannon doth survey\nThe temple’s lights in lantern’s fair display\nThen wander through the markets bright and gay\n\n---\n**Second Day the Shadows of the Past Explore**\nTo Meiji’s shrine where pines stand tall and wise\nThe museum’s halls where history’s whispers rise\nWith sumo’s might and geisha’s grace beware\nFor Tokyo’s heart beats bold and wild and rare\n\n---\n**Third Day Let Shinkansen Bear Thee Swiftly O’er**\nTo Kyoto’s streets where time itself doth slow\nThe golden pavilion gleams in softest glow\nAlong the river’s path where willows sway\nAnd temples old in twilight’s veil do play\n\n---\n**Fourth Day in Nara’s Sacred Wooded Keep**\nWhere deer with eyes like coins do boldly tread\nThe Todaiji’s halls where Buddha’s spirit fed\nThen back to Kyoto where tea and sweets are spread\nWith matcha’s green and wagashi’s modest tread\n\n---\n**Fifth Day the Path of Samurai Embrace**\nTo Nara’s castle where warriors once did pace\nOr Osaka’s castles where dreams take flight\nWith takoyaki’s taste and kitsune’s warm delight\nThen rest thy bones in onsen’s steaming grace\n\n---\n**Sixth Day to Hiroshima’s Sorrowful Place**\nWhere peace stands tall in memory’s embrace\nThe museum’s walls where silence speaks the true\nYet life persists in Miyajima’s floating shrine anew\n\n---\n**Seventh Day Return to Tokyo’s Frantic Song**\nWhere Harajuku’s youth in colors brightly throng\nShibuya’s scramble where the world moves fast\nThen Akihabara’s glow where neon dreams are cast\n\n---\n**Eighth Day the Bayside Wonders Seek with Speed**\nTo Yokohama’s Chinatown where lanterns brightly lead\nAnd Kamakura’s Buddhas carved in stone so deep\nWhere waves do crash and ancient stones still keep\n\n---\n**Ninth Day Thy Final Feast of Japan’s Grandeur**\nOne last sushi where fish and rice do blend\nAnd ramen’s broth that warms the coldest end\nWith souvenirs bought and vows thou dost renew\nTo return when next the cherry blossoms blew\n\n---\n**On the Eve of Thy Departure**\nAs planes take wing and Tokyo fades from sight\nRemember well the land of dawn’s bright light\nWhere spirits dance and souls find quiet might\nFarewell dear traveler till our paths align anew in night", "logprobs": [{"token": "H", "logprob": -0.1340528428554535}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.0033846967853605747}, {"token": " h", "logprob": -1.5743343830108643}, {"token": "ark", "logprob": -0.0038254905957728624}, {"token": " good", "logprob": -0.43127602338790894}, {"token": " travel", "logprob": -0.5238686203956604}, {"token": "er", "logprob": -0.0007909983396530151}, {"token": " of", "logprob": -2.118417739868164}, {"token": " lands", "logprob": -1.2227731943130493}, {"token": " far", "logprob": -1.5092707872390747}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.08946250379085541}, {"token": " wide", "logprob": -0.15393288433551788}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -0.060952071100473404}, {"token": "Let", "logprob": -1.260413646697998}, {"token": " qu", "logprob": -1.9242750406265259}, {"token": "ill", "logprob": -0.05633759871125221}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.7055733799934387}, {"token": " par", "logprob": -0.39250457286834717}, {"token": "ch", "logprob": -5.030505417380482e-05}, {"token": "ment", "logprob": -0.0001902399235405028}, {"token": " now", "logprob": -1.2948505878448486}, {"token": " we", "logprob": -1.200838327407837}, {"token": "ave", "logp